---
import Base from '~/layouts/Base.astro';
import { nap } from '~/data/nap';

const lastUpdated = '2026-08-21';
---
<Base title="Cookie policy · Sincronia Agency" description="Cookie policy of sincronia.agency: which cookies we use, for what purpose and how to manage them.">
  <article class="legal section">
    <div class="container">
      <header class="legal__header">
        <span class="eyebrow">Legal</span>
        <h1>Cookie policy</h1>
        <p class="legal__updated">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>
      </header>
      <div class="legal__content">
        <h2>1. What are cookies?</h2>
        <p>Cookies are small text files that a website stores on your device when you visit it. They let the site remember your actions and preferences for a certain period of time. Similar technologies (localStorage, sessionStorage, web beacons) work in a comparable way and are treated as cookies for the purposes of this policy.</p>

        <h2>2. Which cookies do we use?</h2>
        <h3>Strictly necessary cookies</h3>
        <p>Technical cookies that allow the user to browse the website and use its features. Without them, the site cannot work properly. They are served from the Cloudflare edge and <strong>do not require your consent</strong> because they are essential to deliver the service requested by the user.</p>
        <h3>Analytics cookies</h3>
        <p>Cookies that let us measure the number of visitors and analyse how they browse the site, in order to improve the service. <strong>They are only activated if you give your consent</strong> through the cookie banner. You can accept, reject or configure their use by category at any time.</p>

        <h2>3. Specific cookies we use</h2>
        <table class="cookie-table">
          <thead><tr><th>Cookie</th><th>Type</th><th>Duration</th><th>Purpose</th><th>Provider</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr><td>__cf_bm</td><td>Technical</td><td>30 min</td><td>Cloudflare bot protection</td><td>Cloudflare</td></tr>
            <tr><td>sincronia-consent</td><td>Technical</td><td>12 months</td><td>Stores your cookie consent decision (localStorage)</td><td>Sincronia Agency</td></tr>
            <tr><td>_clck</td><td>Analytics</td><td>12 months</td><td>Clarity ID persistence and session attribution</td><td>Microsoft Clarity</td></tr>
            <tr><td>_clsk</td><td>Analytics</td><td>Session</td><td>Groups a user's actions into a single session</td><td>Microsoft Clarity</td></tr>
            <tr><td>_clv</td><td>Analytics</td><td>12 months</td><td>Aggregated behaviour metrics</td><td>Microsoft Clarity</td></tr>
            <tr><td>CLID</td><td>Analytics</td><td>12 months</td><td>Visitor identifier for Clarity</td><td>Microsoft Clarity</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
        <p class="legal__note"><strong>Cloudflare Web Analytics</strong> does not use cookies and does not identify people: it measures aggregated traffic at the edge. It is only activated if you accept the "Analytics" category.</p>

        <h2>3.1. Third-party scripts for internal audit purposes</h2>
        <p>We additionally load in the <code>&lt;head&gt;</code> the <strong>NytroSEO</strong> script (<a href="https://plugin.nytsys.com/api/site/f06b5630-e22f-44b1-8212-90b5c4def0d4/nytsys.min.js" rel="noopener" target="_blank">script URL</a>), an SEO audit tool that Sincronia uses from its own dashboard to monitor the site's ranking. NytroSEO is not used to profile visitors or to serve advertising. Its data handling policy is the responsibility of the provider and can be consulted on its website.</p>
        <p>If this script starts using cookies in the future, we will add it to the table above and move it behind the consent banner. You can request its permanent blocking at any time by writing to <a href={`mailto:${nap.email}`}>{nap.email}</a>.</p>

        <h2>4. Consent</h2>
        <p>When you visit the site for the first time, we show you a banner with three options:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Accept all:</strong> activates all categories.</li>
          <li><strong>Reject all:</strong> only strictly necessary cookies are kept.</li>
          <li><strong>Configure:</strong> you can enable or disable the "Analytics" category granularly and save your preference.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>Your decision is stored in <code>localStorage</code> for 12 months. Until you decide, we do not load any analytics script nor set any measurement cookie.</p>

        <h2>5. How to withdraw or change your consent</h2>
        <p>You can change your decision at any time by clicking the <strong>"Manage cookies"</strong> button in the page footer, or by manually clearing the browser's storage data for this site. You can also block or delete cookies from your browser settings:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="https://support.google.com/chrome/answer/95647" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Chrome</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/kb/clear-cookies-and-site-data-firefox" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Firefox</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://support.apple.com/guide/safari/manage-cookies-and-website-data-sfri11471/mac" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Safari</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://support.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-edge/delete-cookies-in-microsoft-edge" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Edge</a></li>
        </ul>
        <p>Please note that, if you block all cookies, you may not be able to access some features of the website.</p>

        <h2>6. International transfers</h2>
        <p>Microsoft Clarity (Microsoft Corporation, USA) may transfer data to servers outside the European Economic Area. Such transfers rely on the European Commission's Standard Contractual Clauses and on adequacy decisions applicable to the United States (Data Privacy Framework). More information in the <a href="https://privacy.microsoft.com/en-us/privacystatement" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Microsoft privacy statement</a>.</p>

        <h2>7. More information</h2>
        <p>If you have any questions about our cookie policy, write to us at <a href={`mailto:${nap.email}`}>{nap.email}</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</Base>

<style>
  .legal__header { text-align: center; max-width: 700px; margin: 0 auto var(--s-10); }
  .legal__header .eyebrow { display: inline-block; }
  .legal__updated { color: var(--c-muted); font-size: 0.875rem; margin-top: var(--s-2); }
  .legal__content { max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .legal__content h2 { font-size: 1.25rem; margin-top: var(--s-8); margin-bottom: var(--s-3); color: var(--c-ink); }
  .legal__content h2:first-child { margin-top: 0; }
  .legal__content h3 { font-size: 1.0625rem; margin-top: var(--s-5); margin-bottom: var(--s-2); color: var(--c-ink); }
  .legal__content p, .legal__content ul { color: var(--c-text); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: var(--s-3); }
  .legal__content ul { padding-left: var(--s-5); }
  .legal__content li { margin-bottom: 0.4rem; }
  .legal__content a { color: var(--c-coral-700); text-decoration: underline; }
  .legal__content code { background: var(--c-bg-alt); padding: 0.1em 0.4em; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 0.85em; }
  .legal__note { font-size: 0.875rem; color: var(--c-muted); margin-top: var(--s-2); }
  .cookie-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin: var(--s-4) 0 var(--s-6); font-size: 0.875rem; }
  .cookie-table th, .cookie-table td { text-align: left; padding: var(--s-2) var(--s-3); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--c-line); vertical-align: top; }
  .cookie-table th { background: var(--c-bg-alt); font-weight: 600; color: var(--c-ink); }
</style>
